    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d506">

                <pb facs="0632" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg524"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            McKenzie.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received Mr. Hicks, No. 512, of the
                    17th ultimo, reporting the final settlement of the claim of Enrique Meier, our
                    acting consular agent at Mollendo, by the payment to him for the claimant of
                    2,000 sols from the Peruvian Government, and am gratified to learn that the
                    settlement was reached in this straightforward and friendly way.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
